OL,3,AForensic expert says his analysis
OL,4,Araises doubts about how Epstein died
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails and references to suicide
OL,9,FA forensic expert has said he believes
OL,10,Fthat convicted sex offender Jeffery
OL,11,FEpstein's death in prison was the
OL,12,Fresult of a homicide, not suicide.
OL,14,FSpeaking to BBC Newsnight, Professor
OL,15,FMichael Freeman said that after
OL,16,Freviewing the New York City medical
OL,17,Fexaminer's file he believes Epstein was
OL,18,Fstrangled, most likely from behind.
