OL,3,AForensic expert says his analysis
OL,4,Araises doubts about how Epstein died
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe medical examiner who carried out
OL,7,Fthe autopsy concluded in 2019 that
OL,8,FEpstein's injuries were consistent with
OL,9,Fsuicide and there was no evidence of
OL,10,Fthe defensive wounds expected if his
OL,11,Fdeath had been a homicide.
